{
  "id": 20220,
  "contacts": {
    "id": 1321,
    "name": "달리아",
    "icon": "1321",
    "signature": "왜 말이 없어?",
    "typeId": 1,
    "type": "캐릭터"
  },
  "relatedMessages": [
    20219,
    20220,
    20221
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2022000,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202200000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202200000": {
          "id": 202200000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}, 페나코니에는 아직 발굴되지 않은 기억이 더 있다는 걸 알고 있니?",
          "next": [
            202200001
          ]
        },
        "202200001": {
          "id": 202200001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "사람들은 그것을 제대로 이해하지 못했어. 방금 그 기억을 되찾은 너조차도",
          "next": [
            202200002
          ]
        },
        "202200002": {
          "id": 202200002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "네가 잘 알고 있는 사람들, 그리고 아무도 모르는 비밀들, 궁금하지 않아?",
          "next": [
            202200003
          ]
        },
        "202200003": {
          "id": 202200003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "영원한 불길의 밤에, 칼집으로 불꽃을 피워올린 여인",
          "next": [
            202200004
          ]
        },
        "202200004": {
          "id": 202200004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "아니면… 널 주시하고 있는 헌터들?",
          "next": [
            202200005
          ]
        },
        "202200005": {
          "id": 202200005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "물론 나도 있지. 난 너한테 마음을 활짝 열 준비가 되어 있어",
          "next": [
            202200006
          ]
        },
        "202200006": {
          "id": 202200006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "내가 기억을 일부 태워버리기 전에 먼저 너랑 공유할게~",
          "next": [
            202200007,
            202200016,
            202200022
          ]
        },
        "202200007": {
          "id": 202200007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "아케론 씨 자신도 모를 수도 있는 비밀을 듣고 싶어요",
          "next": [
            202200008
          ]
        },
        "202200008": {
          "id": 202200008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "그날 밤 마지막 불꽃이 사그라들 때",
          "next": [
            202200009
          ]
        },
        "202200009": {
          "id": 202200009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "난 봤어",
          "next": [
            202200010
          ]
        },
        "202200010": {
          "id": 202200010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "그녀는 설계도 한 장을 가져갔지만, 아쉽게도 그건 지도가 아니라",
          "next": [
            202200011
          ]
        },
        "202200011": {
          "id": 202200011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "「메뉴」였어",
          "next": [
            202200012
          ]
        },
        "202200012": {
          "id": 202200012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "하지만 아마 그녀는 아직도 모르고 있을 거야~",
          "next": [
            202200013
          ]
        },
        "202200013": {
          "id": 202200013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "배가 고팠던 걸 수도 있잖아요. 아케론 씨가 요리 잘하는 거 모르시죠?",
          "next": [
            202200014
          ]
        },
        "202200014": {
          "id": 202200014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "누가 알겠어?",
          "next": [
            202200015
          ]
        },
        "202200015": {
          "id": 202200015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "어쩌면… 난 먹어본 적 있을지도?",
          "next": [
            202200028
          ]
        },
        "202200016": {
          "id": 202200016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "당시에 정말 스텔라론 헌터에 잠입했다고요? 좀 의심스러운데요",
          "next": [
            202200017
          ]
        },
        "202200017": {
          "id": 202200017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "그들의 비밀 하나 말해볼래요?",
          "next": [
            202200018
          ]
        },
        "202200018": {
          "id": 202200018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "스텔라론의 사냥꾼, 운명의 노예…. 후후, 이런 것들로는 너희들의 유대를 다 설명할 수 없지",
          "next": [
            202200019
          ]
        },
        "202200019": {
          "id": 202200019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "그들한테 「각본」 단톡방이 왜 42개나 있는 걸까? 너무 궁금해",
          "next": [
            202200020
          ]
        },
        "202200020": {
          "id": 202200020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "수학 못하시나 봐요. 56개 아닌가요?",
          "next": [
            202200021
          ]
        },
        "202200021": {
          "id": 202200021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "내가 어느 단톡방에 있을 것 같아?",
          "next": [
            202200028
          ]
        },
        "202200022": {
          "id": 202200022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "당신의 숨겨진 비밀이 궁금해요",
          "next": [
            202200023
          ]
        },
        "202200023": {
          "id": 202200023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "나는 「별호수 식초 생선 신교」와 반 앰버기원을 동행한 적이 있어",
          "next": [
            202200024
          ]
        },
        "202200024": {
          "id": 202200024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "그들의 슬로건은 「아래엔 천국이요, 위엔 별호수라. 한번 맛보면 다시는 신맛을 먹지 못하리」였어",
          "next": [
            202200025
          ]
        },
        "202200025": {
          "id": 202200025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "아쉽게도 아무도 기억하지 못하지. 기억은 늘 이렇게 시련 앞에 무너진다니까",
          "next": [
            202200026
          ]
        },
        "202200026": {
          "id": 202200026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "이제 다들 알게 됐으니, 당신이 구호를 외치는 걸 듣고 싶어요",
          "next": [
            202200027
          ]
        },
        "202200027": {
          "id": 202200027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "그러려면 추가 대가를 지불해야 해",
          "next": [
            202200028
          ]
        },
        "202200028": {
          "id": 202200028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "소수만 아는 비밀을 알게 됐네요!",
          "next": [
            202200029
          ]
        },
        "202200029": {
          "id": 202200029,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "친절에 보답하는 의미로 저도 비밀 하나 알려줄게요!",
          "next": [
            202200030
          ]
        },
        "202200030": {
          "id": 202200030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "사실……",
          "next": [
            202200031
          ]
        },
        "202200031": {
          "id": 202200031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "사실 미하일 씨는 예전에 배우를 한 적이 있었어요",
          "next": [
            202200032
          ]
        },
        "202200032": {
          "id": 202200032,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "text": "네가 하는 말이니, 진짜라고 믿을게?",
          "next": [
            202200033
          ]
        },
        "202200033": {
          "id": 202200033,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1321,
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1321,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}